  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 48. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 最前列 — 並んだ列のいちばん前。\n2. 最大 — 最も大きいこと。\n3. 最長 — 最も長いこと。\n4. サイト — インターネットでひとまとまりになったページの集まり。\n5. サイドカー — オートバイの横に取りつける乗客用の車。\n6. 細部 — 細かいところ。\n7. 採用 — 人や方法などを選んで取り入れること。\n8. サイロ — 穀物や家畜のえさなどをためる大きな容器や建物。\n9. サウスポー — 野球などで左手を主に使う選手。\n10. サウンド — 音や音楽の響き。\n11. 境目 — 二つの場所や状態を分けるところ。\n12. 作業 — 目的のために手や体などを使ってする仕事。\n13. 搾乳 — 牛などから乳を搾ること。\n14. 作風 — 作品に表れるその作者らしい特徴。\n15. 叫び声 — 大きく強く出す声。\n16. 裂け目 — 物が裂けてできた隙間。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\nDo not add numerical claims, prices, quantities, currency denominations, calorie values or stroke-order numbers unless explicitly required by the target word. 